@startuml
!include theme.iuml
title Email account access and private request binding
hide footbox
autonumber
actor User
participant "AuthGate\n<<React function>>" as Web
participant "auth.py\n<<routes / middleware>>" as Auth
participant "store : AuthStore" as Store
participant "SMTP / development outbox" as Mail
participant "workspaces.py\n<<context factory>>" as Context
participant "workspace : WorkspaceStore" as Workspace
participant "Private API route" as API

activate User
User -> Web : submit registration
activate Web
Web -> Auth : POST /auth/register
activate Auth
Auth -> Store : throttle; create identity; issue verification token
activate Store
note over Store : Password hashing and database work run off the event loop.\nStore only password hashes and token digests.
Store --> Auth : eligible identity + one-time token, or no new identity
deactivate Store
opt new account
  Auth -> Mail : deliver verification link
  activate Mail
  Mail --> Auth : accepted or explicit delivery error
  deactivate Mail
end
Auth --> Web : generic 202 message or service error
deactivate Auth
Web --> User : check email
deactivate Web

User -> Web : open verification link and press Verify
activate Web
Web -> Auth : POST /auth/verify-email {token}
activate Auth
Auth -> Store : consume_token(token, verify)
activate Store
Store --> Auth : verified or expired/used error
deactivate Store
Auth --> Web : outcome
deactivate Auth
Web --> User : sign-in form or actionable error
deactivate Web

User -> Web : submit email and password
activate Web
Web -> Auth : POST /auth/login
activate Auth
Auth -> Store : verify password + verified status; create session
activate Store
Store --> Auth : identity + random session, or failure
deactivate Store
Auth --> Web : HttpOnly cookie + session-specific CSRF token
deactivate Auth
Web --> User : private workspace
deactivate Web

User -> Web : save a manual statement in selected project
activate Web
Web -> Auth : POST /api/dataset\ncookie, Origin, CSRF, project header
activate Auth
Auth -> Store : validate session and enforce request allowance
activate Store
Store --> Auth : verified identity or rejection
deactivate Store
alt valid session, origin and CSRF
  Auth -> Context : enter async private workspace context
  activate Context
  Context -> Workspace : initialize/validate account and project off event loop
  activate Workspace
  Workspace --> Context : store or storage error
  deactivate Workspace
  Context --> Auth : request-local dataset + coursework bindings
  deactivate Context
  Auth -> API : dispatch validated request
  activate API
  API -> Workspace : locked transactional mutation
  activate Workspace
  Workspace --> API : saved entry + recorded revision, or failure
  deactivate Workspace
  API --> Auth : response
  deactivate API
  Auth -> Context : exit context
  activate Context
  Context --> Auth : previous ContextVars restored
  deactivate Context
else access rejected
  note over Auth : No private route executes; return 401 / 403 / 429.
end
Auth --> Web : result or explicit error
deactivate Auth
Web --> User : saved state or retained draft + error
deactivate Web
deactivate User
legend bottom
  Registration, verification and login are separate interactions, not automatic sign-in.
  Synchronous/awaited messages all have explicit activation boxes and matching replies.
  Password reset uses the same single-use token boundary and revokes every prior session.
endlegend
@enduml
